  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ehxcnowv2z_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ehxcnowv2z_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>海外版 4399 poki.com ，月访问量1.26亿。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ehxcnowv2z_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>其中5270万访问量来自于自然搜索。</div>\n<div>31%来自于非品牌搜索，也就是1633万流量来自于游戏本身的搜索。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ehxcnowv2z_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ehxcnowv2z_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ehxcnowv2z_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>做了多语言处理，把各个语言的游戏相关搜索量都吃到了。</div>",
